00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:02.179
Hi everyone and welcome to the table

00:05:02.839 --> 00:05:07.420
My name is Karen and we're so glad that you're here tonight this Sunday evening

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:14.119
We are live and I want to say just a really special shout out to my mom who is tuning in right now

00:05:14.119 --> 00:05:18.519
Hi, mom. I love you. Happy Mother's Day as others are joining us online

00:05:19.239 --> 00:05:25.160
I want to share a couple of announcements and please do start commenting down below. Let us know you're here

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:31.480
We want to be able to welcome you personally, so just let us know who you are where you're watching from

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.320
So first announcement, we've been

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:44.040
highlighting each of our meetups lately and meetups are our small groups at the table and this week I have the honor of

00:05:45.239 --> 00:05:50.119
spotlighting our men's support group led by the amazing Daryl Adams and

00:05:51.119 --> 00:05:55.959
They meet online every Tuesday night at 7 p.m. Via Google Meets

00:05:56.679 --> 00:06:02.040
it's a safe place where guys can share about their lives and open and vulnerable ways and

00:06:02.399 --> 00:06:07.480
Like Daryl says you don't even have to get up off the couch to join in and I'll add to that

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:12.579
You don't even have to live in the area to join in because all of our meetups are virtual you can

00:06:13.519 --> 00:06:17.359
Join from wherever you are and Daryl would love to have you

00:06:18.079 --> 00:06:25.239
So if you are interested in being part of that and checking it out, you can reach out to Daryl directly at Daryl

00:06:26.519 --> 00:06:34.799
Daryl at the table TX org or you can comment below or reach out to the table directly and we'll make sure to put

00:06:34.799 --> 00:06:36.600
You in touch with Daryl

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:42.880
Secondly tonight. We're having a very special panel discussion on stress anxiety

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:45.600
Depression and the church

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:52.320
obviously, this is a timely topic right now that touches all of us whether directly or indirectly and

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.440
The discussion will include some Q&A

00:06:55.679 --> 00:07:00.000
So we would love to be able to include your questions that you have for our panelists

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:06.239
So if you think of a question between now and then that please feel free to note that in the comments below

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:09.359
Or you can text it to us at nine seven two

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.920
eight three seven seven

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:17.119
Seven one nine one and we'll make sure to put that in the comments, too. So you have it

00:07:17.119 --> 00:07:22.559
I can't promise we'll be able to get to all of the questions, but we promise to do our best

00:07:23.559 --> 00:07:28.760
And as I'm sure you are already well aware of today is Mother's Day

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:36.359
This can be a day of great joy and celebration and also a day of deep sadness

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.040
grief and longing

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:43.959
It can be especially difficult for our LGBTQ friends, I

00:07:44.559 --> 00:07:46.959
also can't help but think of

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.720
Ahmad Arbery's mom

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:57.959
Wanda as she grieves the murder of her son and the cover-up that went with it and the injustice

00:07:57.959 --> 00:08:02.160
I just can't imagine what she's going through right now. So

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:08.279
just as a church, we want to make sure we're lifting her and the rest of Ahmad's family up in prayer and

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:15.320
It's just a good reminder you guys. Let's not just let this be a hashtag that passes over in a week

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.600
Let's learn and lean in and listen

00:08:19.519 --> 00:08:22.720
and and learn how to be

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:31.359
Not just good people but actively anti-racist. It's time. So I hope as a church will will commit to that

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.159
So wherever you find yourself today

